cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fig-atlas: config-driven, verifiable and provenance-tracked publication figures"
abstract: >-
  A framework for generating manuscript figures reproducibly: FigureSpec
  declarations drive publishing, README generation and verification;
  YAML configs control every visual parameter; figures are drawn 1:1 at
  final print size and audited for printed font and line sizes; storyline
  compendia are compiled and archived per revision.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kim
    given-names: Yong Gyu
repository-code: "https://github.com/ibs-cmg-ngs/fig-atlas"
license: MIT
url: "https://ibs-cmg-ngs.github.io/fig-atlas/"
keywords:
  - scientific figures
  - reproducibility
  - matplotlib
  - publication
